@baseUrl = http://localhost:3020
@reportKey = invoice-amounts
@invoiceDateFrom = 2026-01-01
@invoiceDateTo = 2026-12-31

### List implemented reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports
Accept: application/json

### Get one report definition
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{reportKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Run report preview
### Invoice output now includes invoice-level totals such as totalTreatments and totalProducts.
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{reportKey}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "invoiceDateFrom": "{{invoiceDateFrom}}",
  "invoiceDateTo": "{{invoiceDateTo}}"
}

### Download report as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{reportKey}}/download?format=csv&invoiceDateFrom={{invoiceDateFrom}}&invoiceDateTo={{invoiceDateTo}}
Accept: text/csv

### Download report as Excel with invoice-level totalTreatments and totalProducts output
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{reportKey}}/download?format=xlsx&invoiceDateFrom={{invoiceDateFrom}}&invoiceDateTo={{invoiceDateTo}}
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
